==Description==
'''Ducky Doom Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Ducky Revenge Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 39 on the regular track. It had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,410}} or {{Robux|108}} ({{Robux|91}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|25,630}} or {{Robux|3,430}} ({{Robux|2,897}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Ducky Doom Charm''' appearance is based on the [[Ducky D00M III]]. It has the mech extend its chainsaws out. It plays a sound of a totem falling down with a duck quack in the background.

The color changes based on the player's username color, but appears orange in inventory preview.

